WJC Vipin Kumar Pandey vs The State Of Bihar Through The Home ... on 7 August, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/118955246/
1 No.1626 of 2024(2) dt.07-08-2025 Janta Bazaar P.S. Case No. 130 of 2022, dated.
23/06/2022, registered under section 323, 379, 384, 420, 406, 467, 468, 471, and 120-B of The Indian Penal Code, 1860 and section 27 of The Arms Act 1959;
(ii) For issuance of appropriate Writ/Writs, direction/directions or orders/order to the concerned respondents to conduct free and fair investigation in the present matter to secure the ends of justice;

(iii) For issuance of appropriate Writ/Writs, direction/directions or orders/order to change the investigating officer of Janta Bazaar P.S. Case No. 130 of 2022 for the sake of proper and fair investigation;
(iv) For issuance of appropriate Writ / Writs, direction /directions or orders / order to the concerned Respondents to investigate the involvement of the District Transport Officer at Patna and his office employees;
(v) For issuance of appropriate Writ/Writs, direction/directions or orders/order to the concerned respondents for the recovery of the J.C.B bearing Registration No.
BR-01GF- 8491, Chassis No. 01500272, Engine/Motor No. H00134828, belonging to the petitioner/informant;
(vi) For issuance of appropriate Writ/Writs, direction/orders/order to the concerned respondents to grant compensation of Rupees Fifteen Lacs to the petitioner in order to indemnify the benefit which would have accrued to the petitioner from his JCB vehicle bearing Registration No. BR-01GF-8491 andwas denied due to the negligence of the investigating officer;
(vii) For issuance of appropriate Writ/Writs, direction/directions or orders/order to cancel the bail given to the accused person namely Abhay Kumar vide order dated. 05/04/2024 (Annexure- P/11)
by the Learned Court of Sessions Judge at Chapra in ABP No. 4693 of 2023.
Patna High Court CR. WJC No.1626 of 2024(2) dt.07-08-2025 3.
